13. PW-1 has affirmed in the evidentiary affidavit Ex.PW1/A that he was employed as a driver with Anurag Water Supply Company, New Delhi and while driving his company truck bearing Reg. No.
HR 55AX 9787 at Okhla Phase-II on main road from Crown Plaza to Sarita Vihar, he stopped the water tanker for some welding work on 11.12.2022 at about 10.00 AM for which he got down to check the work done, in the meanwhile, another water tanker bearing no. DL 1GC 4793 also came in high speed for some welding work and being unable to control the vehicle, hit him from behind due to which, he got stuck between the two trucks and sustained serious injuries.
